  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Almost always used in the 3rd person (like **pasar**), since its subject is usually an event: *¿qué ocurre?* (what's going on?), *ocurrió un accidente* (an accident happened)",
    "Common reflexive/pronominal use **ocurrírsele algo a alguien** (for an idea to occur to someone): *se me ocurrió una idea* (an idea occurred to me / I had an idea)",
    "Synonym: **pasar**, **suceder**"
